s</td><td align="right" style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;color:#111111;font-weight:700;padding:6px 0;border-top:1px solid #F5F5F5;">{{ milestone_value }}</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class="mw-px" style="padding:32px 48px 48px 48px;"><a href="{{ benchmark_url }}" style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;letter-spacing:0.02em;">See the full benchmark &rarr;</a></td></tr><tr><td class="mw-px" style="padding:24px 48px 48px 48px;border-top:1px solid #E5E5E5;"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A3A3A3;line-height:1.7;">Sent because you crossed a tracked threshold.<br><a href="{{ unsubscribe_url }}" style="color:#A3A3A3;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a></div></td></tr></table></body></html>$b$,
