         $b$<!doctype html><html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light"><meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light"><title>Honest-Math Discount</title><style>body{margin:0;padding:0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;text-size-adjust:100%;}table{border-collapse:collapse;}img{border:0;max-width:100%;height:auto;}@media only screen and (max-width:620px){.mw-px{padding-left:20px!important;padding-right:20px!important;}.mw-title{font-size:24px!important;line-height:30px!important;}.mw-display{font-size:34px!important;line-height:38px!important;}.mw-hero{font-size:56px!important;line-height:56px!important;}.mw-stack{display:block!important;width:100%!important;max-width:100%!important;box-sizing:border-box;}.mw-stack-gap{padding:0 0 24px 0!important;}.mw-full{width:100%!important;max-width:100%!important;}.mw-btn{min-width:0!important;}.mw-tight{letter-spacing:0.06em!important;}}</style></head><body style="margin:0;padding:0;word-break:break-word;overflow-wrap:anywhere;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 auto;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;width:100%;max-width:600px;"><tr><td class="mw-px" style="padding:48px 40px 8px 40px;"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;color:#94A3B8;letter-spacing:0.08em;width:0;min-width:100%;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;">───────────────────────────</div></td></tr><tr><td class="mw-px" style="padding:16px 40px 8px 40px;"><h1 style="margin:0;font-size:24px;line-height:32px;font-weight:600;color:#0F172A;letter-spacing:-0.01em;">A discount feels weird, so here&rsquo;s the math</h1></td></tr><tr><td class="mw-px" style="padding:20px 40px 8px 40px;"><p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#334155;">{{ reason_paragraph }}</p><p style="margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#334155;">We over-forecasted on infra this quarter. The capacity is already paid for, so we&rsquo;d rather move it than waste it. That&rsquo;s the whole reason. No urgency tricks, no fake scarcity &mdash; just a window that closes when it closes.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="mw-px" style="padding:32px 40px 0 40px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;"><tr><td style="height:44px;padding:12px 0;vertical-align:middle;"><span style="font-size:11px;line-height:14px;color:#64748B;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.12em;font-weight:600;">Original</span></td><td align="right" style="height:44px;padding:12px 0;vertical-align:middle;"><span style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:18px;line-height:22px;color:#0F172A;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;">{{ original_price }}</span></td></tr><tr><td style="height:44px;padding:12px 0;vertical-align:middle;"><span style="font-size:11px;line-height:14px;color:#64748B;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.12em;font-weight:600;">Discount</span></td><td align="right" style="height:44px;padding:12px 0;vertical-align:middle;"><span style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:18px;line-height:22px;color:#0F172A;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;">&minus;&nbsp;{{ discount_amount }}</span></td></tr><tr><td style="height:44px;padding:16px 0 12px 0;vertical-align:middle;border-top:1px solid #E2E8F0;"><span style="font-size:11px;line-height:14px;color:#64748B;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.12em;font-weight:600;">Final</span></td><td align="right" style="height:44px;padding:16px 0 12px 0;vertical-align:middle;border-top:1px solid #E2E8F0;"><span style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:18px;line-height:22px;color:#0F766E;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600;">{{ final_price }}</span></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class="mw-px" style="padding:36px 40px 0 40px;"><div style="font-size:11px;line-height:14px;color:#DC2626;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.14em;font-weight:600;font-variant:small-caps;">Not right for you if&hellip;</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;margin-top:14px;"><tr><td style="padding:6px 0;vertical-align:top;width:20px;"><span style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:14px;color:#94A3B8;">&mdash;</span></td><td style="padding:6px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#334155;">You&rsquo;re still evaluating whether the problem is worth solving. Wait until you&rsquo;re sure &mdash; the price will come back.</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6px 0;vertical-align:top;width:20px;"><span style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:14px;color:#94A3B8;">&mdash;</span></td><td style="padding:6px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#334155;">You don&rsquo;t have time to onboard this month. Discounted or not, an unused tool is the most expensive one.</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class="mw-px" align="center" style="padding:36px 40px 8px 40px;"><a href="{{ claim_url }}" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#0F766E;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:999px;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;">Claim the price</a></td></tr><tr><td class="mw-px" align="center" style="padding:4px 40px 0 40px;"><span style="font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#64748B;">or </span><a href="mailto:{{ reply_to_email }}" style="font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#0F766E;text-decoration:underline;">reply to this email</a><span style="font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#64748B;"> with questions</span></td></tr><tr><td class="mw-px" align="center" style="padding:28px 40px 8px 40px;"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#64748B;letter-spacing:0.04em;">Window closes <span style="color:#0F172A;">{{ deadline }}</span></div></td></tr><tr><td class="mw-px" style="padding:24px 40px 8px 40px;"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;color:#CBD5E1;letter-spacing:0.08em;width:0;min-width:100%;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;">───────────────────────────</div></td></tr><tr><td class="mw-px" align="center" style="padding:8px 40px 40px 40px;"><p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#94A3B8;">You&rsquo;re getting this because you opted in for product updates.<br/><a href="{{ unsubscribe_url }}" style="color:#64748B;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr></table></body></html>$b$,
