><td class="mw-px" style="padding:12px 32px 8px 32px;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#525252;">Enter this code on the original device:</td></tr><tr><td class="mw-px" style="padding:8px 32px 24px 32px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#F4F4F5;border:1px dashed #D4D4D8;border-radius:14px;"><tr><td class="mw-display" align="center" style="padding:28px 16px 12px 16px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:48px;line-height:56px;font-weight:700;color:#0A0A0A;letter-spacing:0.15em;">{{ code }}</td></tr><tr><td align="center" style="padding:0 16px 24px 16px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;font-weight:600;color:#71717A;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;">Valid for {{ expiry_minutes }} minutes</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class="mw-px" style="padding:0 32px 16px 32px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;font-weight:600;color:#A1A1AA;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;">▌▌▌ REQUEST DETAILS</td></tr><tr><td class="mw-px" style="padding:0 32px 8px 32px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;"><tr><td style="padding:12px 0 12px 0;width:90px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#A1A1AA;letter-spacing:0.05em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:top;">Device</td><td style="padding:12px 0 12px 0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#0A0A0A;font-weight:500;">{{ device_label }}</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:12px 0 12px 0;width:90px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#A1A1AA;letter-spacing:0.05em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:top;border-top:1px solid #F4F